    <briefdescription>
<para>Callable bond base class. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Base callable bond class for fixed and zero coupon bonds. Defines commonalities between fixed and zero coupon callable bonds. At present, only European and Bermudan put/call schedules supported (no American optionality), as defined by the Callability class.</para><para><xrefsect id="todo_1_todo000005"><xreftitle>Possible enhancements</xreftitle><xrefdescription><para>models/shortrate/calibrationHelpers </para><para>OAS/OAD </para><para>floating rate callable bonds ?</para></xrefdescription></xrefsect></para>    </detaileddescription>
